Ushas is a world very far from [[Færrin]] and the home of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]]. Its people count their years from a founding, or a second founding, and make the present year 72. Few from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]] have any reason to go there.
